WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.100
When listing products in the Amazon Store, you'll need to be aware of product restrictions and conditions.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:15.458
Properly listing products helps keep your account health in good standing and helps earn customer

00:00:15.458 --> 00:00:15.880
trust.

00:00:15.880 --> 00:00:21.666
Before creating your first listing, start by reviewing the Overview of Categories page for specific

00:00:21.666 --> 00:00:23.980
listing requirements related to your products.

00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:30.713
All products for sale in the Amazon Store must comply with all applicable laws, regulations, and

00:00:30.713 --> 00:00:31.480
Amazon policies.

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:37.360
Some products are considered restricted or prohibited categories by Amazon.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:42.882
Restricted products require sellers to obtain approval before being permitted to list them in the

00:00:42.882 --> 00:00:43.560
Amazon Store.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:50.000
For example, categories like Health and Personal Care, Beauty and Jewelry are considered restricted.

00:00:50.600 --> 00:00:55.836
Requiring an application to sell restricted products helps us ensure products are safe, authentic,

00:00:55.836 --> 00:00:58.080
and meet local and regional regulations.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:05.044
For a full list of product categories that require approval to sell, search categories and products

00:01:05.044 --> 00:01:07.280
that require approval in Seller Central.

00:01:08.860 --> 00:01:12.580
Prohibited products are products that can't be sold in the Amazon Store.

00:01:13.180 --> 00:01:19.253
These include illegal or dangerous products, recalled products, or products available by prescription

00:01:19.253 --> 00:01:19.720
only.

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:25.328
It's important to note that for some products, there can be both permitted and prohibited listings,

00:01:25.328 --> 00:01:30.918
which is why it's always a good idea to review the restricted products' help pages in Seller Central

00:01:30.918 --> 00:01:32.160
for more detailed information.

00:01:32.660 --> 00:01:37.100
The examples provided here are shared as an informational guide and aren't exhaustive.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:44.427
If you participate or plan to participate in Fulfillment by Amazon or FBA, you should also review

00:01:44.427 --> 00:01:46.200
the FBA Product Restrictions page.

00:01:47.080 --> 00:01:51.820
There are some products that are permitted to be sold but are not eligible for the FBA program.

00:01:52.380 --> 00:01:57.763
When listing in the Amazon Store, you should also ensure the condition of your product is accurately

00:01:57.763 --> 00:01:58.080
reflected.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:03.480
Some products are only allowed to be sold in new conditions, while others can be resold.

00:02:03.960 --> 00:02:09.040
To learn more about product conditions, you can search condition guidelines in Seller Central.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:14.760
Whenever you list in a new category, it is important to review these guidelines again.

00:02:15.320 --> 00:02:20.106
Don't assume a product is permitted, as something as small as a product description could impact

00:02:20.106 --> 00:02:22.200
whether or not it is considered restricted.

00:02:23.200 --> 00:02:28.473
You should also keep up to date with the product industry and applicable laws for any products you

00:02:28.473 --> 00:02:31.260
sell in order to keep your account healthy

00:02:31.260 --> 00:02:34.660
and provide the best possible experience for your customers.
